{"id":"f694412375e5760d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler.md","title":"从程序索引统一产生固定点","display":"thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler — 从程序索引统一产生固定点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler","aliases":["20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler"],"display":"thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler — 从程序索引统一产生固定点","chapter":"2","section":"2.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Proposition 2.2.4","source_printed_pages":[31],"source_pdf_pages":[67],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]","[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler — 从程序索引统一产生固定点"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Proposition 2.2.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>31</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 为候选索引变换。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}fixedpoint\\text{-}compiler}\\vdash\n\\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\forall e,j\\ (g(e)=g(j)\\Rightarrow e=j)\\land\\forall e\\ (\\varphi_e\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\Rightarrow\\varphi_{g(e)}=\\varphi_{\\varphi_e(g(e))})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}fixedpoint\\text{-}compiler}\\vdash\n\\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\forall e,j\\ (g(e)=g(j)\\Rightarrow e=j)\\land\\forall e\\ (\\varphi_e\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\Rightarrow\\varphi_{g(e)}=\\varphi_{\\varphi_e(g(e))})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选全且单射 d(u)，程序 φ_d(u)(z) 先运行 φ_u(u)，再按其输出索引运行 z。以单射参数编译 v(e) 得 φ_v(e)(u)=φ_e(d(u))。取 g(e)=d(v(e))。若 φ_e 全，φ_v(e)(v(e)) 停止，展开得目标固定点。e 的总性是正确性 promise，不是 g 生成索引的停止条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Proposition 2.2.4；印刷页 31；PDF 第 67 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}$ 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}fixedpoint\\text{-}compiler}\\vdash\n\\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\forall e,j\\ (g(e)=g(j)\\Rightarrow e=j)\\land\\forall e\\ (\\varphi_e\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\Rightarrow\\varphi_{g(e)}=\\varphi_{\\varphi_e(g(e))})].","display":true}],"bytes":1656,"backlinks":[{"id":"1272f2abca26252c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-ce-computable-subset]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler]] — 章 2；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler]]"}],"outgoing":["8ba6597a854c206f","743a0376168bb7ec","dc642dd12c05d028","e343870c773cb68e"]}